From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:20:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1457/3799] soh: rename func_808AD3D4 ->
 BgSpot02Objects_IceUpdate

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the params 4 variant: on its cutscene cue it plays the ice-explosion sfx, runs a 32-frame counter and then kills itself.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c     | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c
index 2dbda5b31..cef6fc330 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c
@@ -30,7 +30,8 @@ void BgSpot02Objects_WaitForSwitch(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play);  //
 void BgSpot02Objects_Rise(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808ACB58 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808ACC34: the params 3 variant: steps the lightning frame counter while the cutscene cue is active, kills itself after twelve frames, and plays the thunder sfx on two fixed cutscene frames.
 void BgSpot02Objects_LightningUpdate(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808ACC34 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_808AD3D4(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808AD3D4: the params 4 variant: on its cutscene cue it plays the ice-explosion sfx, runs a 32-frame counter and then kills itself.
+void BgSpot02Objects_IceUpdate(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808AD3D4 [LLM:HIGH]
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_808AD850: the twelve texture frames the bolt effect steps through, bound to segment 8 by its draw function on the frame given by the same counter that kills the actor after twelve.
 static void* sLightningTextures[] = {  // was D_808AD850 [LLM:HIGH]
@@ -119,7 +120,7 @@ void BgSpot02Objects_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
             this->timer = -12;
             this->unk_170 = 0xFFFF;
             Actor_ChangeCategory(play, &play->actorCtx, thisx, ACTORCAT_ITEMACTION);
-            this->actionFunc = func_808AD3D4;
+            this->actionFunc = BgSpot02Objects_IceUpdate;  // was func_808AD3D4 [LLM:HIGH]
             thisx->draw = func_808AD450;
             break;
     }
@@ -279,7 +280,7 @@ void BgSpot02Objects_LightningDraw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
 }
 
-void func_808AD3D4(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play) {
+void BgSpot02Objects_IceUpdate(BgSpot02Objects* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (play->csCtx.state != 0 && play->csCtx.npcActions[2] != NULL && play->csCtx.npcActions[2]->action == 2) {
         if (this->timer == 2) {
             Audio_PlayActorSound2(&this->dyna.actor, NA_SE_IT_EXPLOSION_ICE);
